body:
Kofi and Kojo were given ₵38,000.00 to share. Kojo had ₵7,500.00 more than Kofi. Find

(i) Kofi's share;

(ii) Kojo's share.

A trader paid ₵1,500.00 for 6 drinking cups. One of the cups got broken. The trader sold the remaining 5, making a profit of 10%. Calculate

(i) the cost price of each of the six cups;

(ii) the selling price of each of the five cups;

(iii) the profit made on each of the cups sold.
